<div class="rw-why-text">
<span class="rw-eyebrow rw-rv">Why a Retreat?</span>
<h2 class="rw-title rw-rv">Deep Healing Needs <em>Space</em></h2>
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-rule rw-rv"/>
<p class="rw-rv">1:1 sessions are powerful — but retreats and workshops create something different. When a group of people commit to a shared experience together, <span class="rw-mark">the collective field amplifies the individual journey</span>. There is permission to go deeper, let go more fully and be witnessed in the process.</p>
<p class="rw-rv">HummingBeing retreats and workshops are carefully designed immersive experiences — combining TRE™, Somatic Healing, Breathwork, movement and reflection — in spaces that invite genuine transformation.</p>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="section-sage rw rw-off">
<div class="rw-wrap">
<div class="rw-head">
<span class="rw-eyebrow rw-rv">Our Offerings</span>
<h2 class="rw-title rw-rv">Types of Retreats &amp; Workshops</h2>
<p class="rw-sub rw-rv">From half-day introductions to multi-day immersions — in Singapore, Japan and beyond.</p>
</div>
<div class="rw-off-ui rw-rv">
<div class="rw-off-stage">
<article class="rw-off-panel">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-off-bg"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/hb/images/gallery/gallery-module2-sep2026-5.jpg" style="object-position:50% 60%"/></span>
<div class="rw-off-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></div>
<h3>Half-Day &amp; Day Workshops</h3>
<p>Focused, accessible group sessions introducing somatic practices — TRE™, Breathwork or EFT — in a supportive group setting. Perfect for those curious about somatic work or wanting a deeper dive on a specific modality.</p>
</article>
<article class="rw-off-panel">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-off-bg"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/hb/images/gallery/gallery-ws-3.jpg" style="object-position:50% 45%"/></span>
<div class="rw-off-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></div>
<h3>Weekend Retreats</h3>
<p>Multi-day immersions in carefully chosen locations in Singapore and Japan. A combination of group somatic practice, individual integration time, nature connection and nourishing meals — designed to reset the nervous system at depth.</p>
</article>
<article class="rw-off-panel">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-off-bg"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/hb/images/gallery/gallery-insead-simba-stenqvist.jpg" style="object-position:62% 50%"/></span>
<div class="rw-off-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-building"/></div>
<h3>Corporate Wellness</h3>
<p>Bespoke somatic wellness sessions designed for teams — addressing stress, burnout, communication and resilience at the organisational level. Delivered in-house or off-site, half-day to full-day formats.</p>
</article>
<article class="rw-off-panel">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-off-bg"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/hb/images/gallery/gallery-module2-sep2026-4.jpg" style="object-position:50% 60%"/></span>
<div class="rw-off-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-users"/></div>
<h3>TRE™ Group Sessions</h3>
<p>Facilitated group TRE™ practice — experiencing the body’s natural tremor mechanism together in community. A powerful introduction to TRE™ and an effective regular practice for existing practitioners.</p>
</article>
<article class="rw-off-panel">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-off-bg"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/hb/images/gallery/gallery-screenshot-practice.jpg" style="object-position:60% 40%"/></span>
<div class="rw-off-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-fire"/></div>
<h3>Somatic Healing Circles</h3>
<p>Intimate group healing experiences combining Reiki, Breathwork, EFT and somatic movement. A safe container for deep rest, release and reconnection. Limited to small groups to ensure depth and personal attention.</p>
</article>
<article class="rw-off-panel">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-off-bg"><img alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/hb/images/gallery/gallery-ws-4.jpg" style="object-position:50% 35%"/></span>
<div class="rw-off-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"/></div>
<h3>Professional Training</h3>
<p>Workshops and training programmes for coaches, therapists and wellness practitioners wanting to deepen their embodied practice and integrate somatic approaches into their work with clients.</p>
</article>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="section-cream rw rw-ex">
<div class="rw-wrap">
<div class="rw-head">
<span class="rw-eyebrow rw-rv">Resilience Retreats for Professionals</span>
<h2 class="rw-title rw-rv">Executive Retreat Programmes</h2>
<p class="rw-sub rw-rv">Immersive physiological and strategic resets for leaders ready to perform at their highest level.</p>
</div>
<div class="rw-ex-grid">
<article class="rw-ex-card rw-rv">
<div class="rw-ex-top">
<span class="rw-ex-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-spa"/></span>
<p class="rw-ex-dur"><span class="rw-ex-n">5</span> Days · <span class="rw-ex-n">4</span> Nights</p>
</div>
<h3>The Corporate Detox</h3>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="rw-ex-rh"><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span><span class="rw-ex-nt"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></span><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span><span class="rw-ex-nt"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></span><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span><span class="rw-ex-nt"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></span><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span><span class="rw-ex-nt"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></span><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span></div>
<p>An immersive sanctuary designed to prevent executive burnout and restore sustainable peak performance. By fusing advanced coaching, somatic and mindfulness techniques, this programme physically discharges accumulated stress and bypasses mental fatigue.</p>
<p>Generous daily self-reflection blocks provide the rare luxury of unstructured space to integrate deep breakthroughs and crystallise clear boundaries. You will return to work recalibrated — calm, deeply embodied, and leading with resilient authority.</p>
<a class="hb-card-link rw-ex-link" href="/book">Enquire Now <span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-arr">→</span></a>
</article>
<article class="rw-ex-card rw-ex-alt rw-rv">
<div class="rw-ex-top">
<span class="rw-ex-ic"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt"/></span>
<p class="rw-ex-dur"><span class="rw-ex-n">3</span> Days · <span class="rw-ex-n">2</span> Nights</p>
</div>
<h3>The Quick Reset</h3>
<div aria-hidden="true" class="rw-ex-rh"><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span><span class="rw-ex-nt"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></span><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span><span class="rw-ex-nt"><i class="fa-solid fa-moon"/></span><span class="rw-ex-d"><i class="fa-solid fa-sun"/></span></div>
<p>A rapid down-regulation experience that shifts executives from survival mode into deep physiological recovery. It physically shakes off stored corporate stress while surfacing the subconscious cognitive saboteurs driving burnout.</p>
<p>You will return to work re-centred, equipped with immediate somatic tools to maintain clear boundaries and resilient, calm authority.</p>
<a class="hb-card-link rw-ex-link" href="/book">Enquire Now <span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-arr">→</span></a>
</article>
</div>
<div class="rw-cta rw-rv">
<a class="hb-btn hb-btn-primary" href="/book">Register Your Interest</a>
</div>
</div>
</section><section class="section-white rw rw-arc">
<div class="rw-wrap">
<div class="rw-head">
<span class="rw-eyebrow rw-rv">What to Expect</span>
<h2 class="rw-title rw-rv">A Typical Retreat Experience</h2>
<p class="rw-sub rw-rv">Each retreat is unique — but every one follows the same arc of arrival, release and integration.</p>
</div>
<div class="rw-arc-tl">
<div aria-hidden="true" class="rw-arc-track"><span class="rw-arc-fill"/></div>
<ol class="rw-arc-list">
<li class="rw-arc-step rw-rv">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-arc-node">1</span>
<div class="rw-arc-body">
<h3>Arrival &amp; Grounding</h3>
<p>We begin by slowing down — settling into the body, getting present in the space, and meeting the group with curiosity and openness. No performance, no agenda imposed from the outside.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="rw-arc-step rw-rv">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-arc-node">2</span>
<div class="rw-arc-body">
<h3>Somatic Practice</h3>
<p>Guided TRE™, Breathwork, movement or Somatic Healing sessions — supported by Isabelle throughout. The pace follows the group’s natural rhythm, not a clock.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="rw-arc-step rw-rv">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-arc-node">3</span>
<div class="rw-arc-body">
<h3>Rest &amp; Integration</h3>
<p>Space to rest, journal, reflect or simply be. The body needs time to integrate what has been released — this is not downtime, it is an essential part of the healing arc.</p>
</div>
</li>
<li class="rw-arc-step rw-rv">
<span aria-hidden="true" class="rw-arc-node">4</span>
<div class="rw-arc-body">
<h3>Sharing &amp; Closing</h3>
<p>Optional group sharing in a confidential, supportive container. A closing practice to anchor the experience and prepare you to carry it into daily life.</p>
</div>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
<div class="rw-cta rw-rv">
<a class="hb-btn hb-btn-primary" href="/book">Register Your Interest</a>
</div>
</div>
